<title>USA: Salomon to buy 1 mln newly-issued Price shrs.</title>
<headline>Salomon to buy 1 mln newly-issued Price shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc said Tuesday it agreed to buy one million newly issued shares of Price REIT Inc.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust has about 10.7 million shares outstanding. Its stock closed at 38-3/8 Monday, close to its 52-week high of 38-3/4.</p>
<p>A Price spokesman was not immediately available to elaborate on the deal.</p>
</text>
